  <!-- Section 10: Measuring AI Search Performance -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 fade-up" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); letter-spacing: -0.03em;">Measuring AI Search Performance</h2>

      <p class="text-text-muted max-w-3xl mb-10 fade-up">No Google Search Console for AI citations. Not yet. But measurement is still possible through manual monitoring and emerging tools.</p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="fade-up">
          <div class="prose">
            <h3>Manual Citation Tracking</h3>

            <p>Run target queries across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Copilot, and Google (for AIO). Record whether your business is cited. Key query categories for a Birmingham business:</p>

            <ul>
              <li>Brand name queries ("tell me about [business] Birmingham")</li>
              <li>Service + location ("best [service] in Birmingham")</li>
